   G2 e>G B<Gd>B|G>gd>c B>GG>B|   A>Bc>d e>fg>e|a2 e>d c>AA>g||
 |:c2 g>c e>cg>e|c2 e>f g>ec<e|[1 d2 a>d f>da>f|d>ef>g a>gf<a:|
                               [2 a>fg>e f>de>d|c<ae>d c>AA>g||
